   "verdict": "FALSIFIED",
   "detail": "The fleet is already 35% tracking by capacity-months in 2023, reaching 56% in 2025. Branscomb (COD 2021) and Regan (COD 2022) -- two of the units the object calls 'small fixed-tilt NY8' -- are single-axis tracking. The 56 % end point is right; the 100 % fixed-tilt start point is not."
  },
  "P3_tracking_runs_at_a_higher_cf": {
   "verdict": "FALSIFIED",
